    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317">

                <pb facs="0357" n="241" xml:id="pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1334.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Sullivan.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-24T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 24, 1914, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 20, 3 p.m. Department has made representations to Government of Haiti
                    regarding alleged smuggling of arms and ammunition into Dominican Republic. So
                    inform Government of Santo Domingo. Mail instructions follow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
